  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong></h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Blue Shoe Guys is a trusted PPE and home-care essentials brand serving customers for over a decade. We specialize in premium disposable shoe covers, underpads, gloves, and protective gear designed for medical offices, contractors, pet owners, cleaners, and everyday households. Our products focus on<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>cleanliness, convenience, and reliability</strong>, with millions of units sold across the U.S.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• What makes us different:</strong></h2><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p><strong>Higher quality materials</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>engineered for durability, non-slip safety, and professional-grade protection.</p></li><li><p><strong>Better pricing</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>than major retail brands — we give customers more pads, stronger covers, and thicker layers for less.</p></li><li><p><strong>Consistent inventory and fast U.S. shipping</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>(Amazon + wholesale).</p></li><li><p><strong>Versatile uses</strong>: healthcare, remodeling, pet training, hospitality, real estate, and home protection.</p></li><li><p><strong>Proven track record</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>with 10+ years in business and thousands of 5-star reviews.</p></li></ul><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong></h2><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Earn<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>competitive commissions</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>on every sale you refer through your unique link.</p></li><li><p>Commission applies to<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>all repeat purchases</strong>, not just the first order.</p></li><li><p>Monthly payouts with<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>no minimum follower requirement</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Higher-tier bonuses for affiliates who drive consistent volume (you can customize tiers as needed).</p></li></ul><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• How to promote us:</strong></h2><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Share your unique link in<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, Facebook Groups</strong>, or blogs.</p></li><li><p>Highlight product demos — e.g., durability tests, water-absorption tests, or “real-life use” content for shoe covers and underpads.</p></li><li><p>Create comparison videos showing<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>why Blue Shoe Guys beats traditional brands</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>in quality or price.</p></li><li><p>Promote to niche audiences: contractors, cleaners, pet owners, nurses, realtors, and parents.</p></li><li><p>Post before/after cleaning videos, home-protection tips, or pet-training hacks featuring our products.</p></li></ul><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>• Other information:</strong></h2><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Bulk and wholesale pricing available for creators with professional audiences.</p></li><li><p>We offer<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>seasonal campaigns</strong>, product launches, and bonus challenges to help affiliates earn more.</p></li><li><p>Fast support and personalized guidance for creators who want to grow their income with us.</p></li><li><p>Brand values:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>reliability, practicality, and customer-first service</strong>.</p></li></ul></div>",
